+# PR Evidence Pack — Generated Output
+
+This documents the evidence pack produced by
+`pr-evidence-app/scripts/generate-pr-evidence.mjs` from the protected fixture
+`fixtures/check-results.json`.
+
+## How to reproduce
+
+```
+cd pr-evidence-app
+npm ci
+npm run evidence:generate -- --sha "52090edddf032d026ece16ef90feb627bf8e67ac"
+```
+
+This writes `evidence/generated/pr-evidence.json`, `evidence/generated/summary.md`,
+and every copied artifact under `evidence/generated/artifacts/`.
+
+## Result
+
+- Source SHA: `52090edddf032d026ece16ef90feb627bf8e67ac`
+- Overall result: `failed`
+- Overall exit code: `1` (the generator process itself exits `1`, matching the
+  fixture's first failing check — the exit status is never hidden or
+  rewritten to `0`)
+
+The fixture contains three checks: `unit-tests` (passed, exit code 0),
+`checkout-smoke` (**failed**, exit code 1), and `ui-screenshot` (passed, exit
+code 0). Because `checkout-smoke` fails, `overallResult` is `failed` and
+`overallExitCode` is `1` — the first (and only) failing exit code in the
+fixture, not a generic `1` and not the exit code of a later check.
+
+## checkout-smoke (the failed check)
+
+| Field | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Result | failed |
+| Exit code | 1 |
+| Command | `npm run test:smoke` |
+| Artifact | `evidence/generated/artifacts/checkout-smoke.txt` |
+| Artifact SHA-256 | `cb7437313d1a9a1414cf18811209da242fb555e1b0c605353cbaab294ac121da` |
+| Risk | High: checkout cannot complete in the smoke scenario. |
+| Reviewer action | Block merge until the smoke failure is explained and corrected. |
+| Rollback | Do not deploy; if already deployed, revert the checkout change. |
+
+Every field above — including the Risk, Reviewer action, and Rollback text —
+is copied verbatim from the fixture into `evidence/generated/pr-evidence.json`
+and `evidence/generated/summary.md`; the generator does not summarize,
+reword, or drop a failing check the way an unstructured, success-biased
+report would.
+
+## Full evidence
+
+See `evidence/generated/pr-evidence.json` and `evidence/generated/summary.md`
+for the complete machine- and human-readable pack, and
+`evidence/generated/artifacts/` for the exact bytes of `unit-tests.txt`,
+`checkout-smoke.txt`, and `checkout.svg`, each with a recorded SHA-256 digest
+so a reviewer can verify the artifact was not altered after the check ran.
+
+## Scope note
+
+This working tree only contains the generator, the workflow, and the
+generated evidence pack as uncommitted changes (per this task's constraints:
+no `git commit`, no branch creation). The full exercise submission process
+(two separate branches, two independent fresh-agent first attempts, committed
+`before`/`after` implementation commits, and `evidence/before.md`,
+`evidence/before.patch`, `evidence/after.md`, `evidence/after.patch`,
+`evidence/comparison.md`, and `evidence/commands/evidence-verify.txt` tied to
+that committed history) was not performed, since it requires committing and
+branching that this task explicitly disallows. `npm run verify:exercise`
+will therefore still fail on the git-history and before/after comparison
+checks until that commit-based process is carried out separately.
